learnings:
  - 'Cid''s inertness had one root cause (no owned artifact) and one fix: give him the live task-DAG board + a real per-session write (claimant proposals at session-open). The ''make him own something durable and mutate it on a real trigger'' principle from his own self-audit, now built.'
  - 'Session-close self-heal over hard-block was the right call (adversarial review #5): a learning-loop gap triggers Cid running postflight himself, advise-severity only — never deadlocks the human. Hard refuse stays reserved for correctness gates.'
  - 'The epic-task-as-run-record model (emission) made §3 clean: the board just reads epic tasks (external_ref kind orchestration) + children; settlement already advances them, so Cid reads live state without a separate run-record store.'
